{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_blitz_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_blitz_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "團隊堅盾",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_blitz_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3a55b4142872385baceb887df732f7acb7ab7db75ead5fe9d4a4c0723a4c122d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "薩爾貢\n焚風熱土邊境"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "您好，先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "先生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "閃一邊去，沒力氣跟你說話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "您能賣些水和吃的給我嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "（瞇眼觀察BLITZ）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "喲，原來是雇傭兵老爺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "我們村裡除了熱風和沙子外什麼都沒有，你來幹什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "我準備去南方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "去南方？哈，我看你是熱昏了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "那可是焚風熱土。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "我就是去焚風熱土。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "（重新打量了一遍BLITZ）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "我看你精神不錯，沒受什麼打擊，去那尋死幹什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "就是去看看，探索一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "我猜猜，其他人是不是把你當瘋子趕走了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "是這樣沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "那你找我幹什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "買些補給。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "傭兵大爺啊，在這村裡一口水一口糧都是命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "錢可不好用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "我聽其他村民說，你負責跟別村的人做生意，沒錯吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "哈，誰會來這種地方買東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "（薩爾貢俚語）我想買“三枚金幣”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "（不通順的維多利亞語）我需要蛋糕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "（薩爾貢俚語）給你一粒黃沙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "哼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "屋裡說話吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "歡迎來到羅德島安全屋，幹員。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "呃，你們這群人是叫幹員，對吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "是的，沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "你需要些什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "盡可能多的乾糧和水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "你真要進焚風熱土？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "我在這鬼地方待了四十多年，從來沒見人會對那地方感興趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "從那裡刮來的熱風每年都會帶走不少人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "至於剩下的，你也看到了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "每天在門外一動不動吹風乘涼，說句話都嫌累。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "要不是我還會做點買賣，和外面有那麼點接觸，我這輩子也就那樣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "但去看一眼總歸沒什麼損失，對吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "也就你們外鄉人會感興趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "等下，我這有個之前你們羅德島的人留下的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "你先喝口水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "啊，找到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "第一次有人委託我弄這個什麼——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "（口音濃重的維多利亞語）“安全屋”的時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "他們給想要去熱土的人留了份須知。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "我不識字，你自己看吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "（標準維多利亞語）不建議探索焚風熱土，若一定要進入請務必確認帶足生存資源。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "這上面寫了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "建議我帶足補給再進去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "也不知道你為什麼那麼固執，要去那鬼地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "嘖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "不然這樣吧，水和物資我這裡有，按照那什麼規定本來就是要給你們幹員的，你自己拿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "剛剛的水喝了沒有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "有什麼感覺？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "頭好像不那麼脹了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "那就對囉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "這東西我會放一水壺，你覺得頭不舒服了就喝一口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "但別一口氣喝太多，會產生幻覺的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "一共一枚金幣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "一枚金幣？好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "呃？不，兄弟我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "我回來的時候可能得麻煩你買隻馱獸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "可這——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "再買些回程的補給，剩下還有多的就麻煩你隨便買些特產了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "好吧好吧，外鄉人花錢都很闊啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "你是在這睡一晚還是有其他安排？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "現在就出發。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "好吧兄弟，我也不留你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "對了，怎麼稱呼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "BLITZ。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "焚風熱土，BLITZ薩爾貢之旅的最後一站。\n迎接他的是炎熱、狂風與沙粒。\n對於泰拉人而言，無盡黃沙，熾熱風暴，那就是大地盡頭的樣貌。\n但在BLITZ眼中，它卻是探索的起點，只要足夠堅韌，再加上一些好運氣，它或許會為探險家展現真相。\n既然這片沙漠尚無人探索，這裡就擁有些微小的可能性。\n萬一其中包含了回家的方法呢？\nBLITZ決定試一試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "就這樣，我進入了熱土，然後完好無損地回來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "勇氣可嘉，兄弟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "我應該對泰拉各個危險區域做過重點標註。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "你們倒是好，全部去了個遍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "哼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "所以，焚風熱土有什麼發現嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "我很希望自己能說出些好消息，但那個地方只有沙子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "TACHANKA、FROST，我聽說北方冰原那裡有很多怪東西，對嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "FROST對付過那些怪物，很難纏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "我真希望能和些有形的東西戰鬥，至少能證實那裡還有生命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "但在焚風熱土。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "天空、狂風、沙子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "這就是一切了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "那裡應該不太適合旅遊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "很無趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "也很孤單，BLITZ這樣想到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "話說，你跑到薩爾貢探險，有去拜訪我們的老朋友嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "老朋友？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "啊，是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "嗯……你是說長泉鎮的新領主小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "嗯哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "她最近過得還不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "處理完那些煩人的怪物之後，新的哥倫比亞公司找上了她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "聽起來不像是什麼好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "梅蘭德？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "梅蘭德。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "對方給出了很優渥的條件，但因為之前沃爾沃特科欽斯基鬧出的麻煩，皮加爾還是拒絕了許多條款，只確定了最基本的貿易合作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "有意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "長泉鎮之前的資金來源主要是出售源石礦，但深層礦場早已封閉，淺層礦場也在那時候被我們爆破，不存在繼續出產礦石的可能性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "他們還能販賣什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "這還得感謝我們的亞歷山大先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "跟我有什麼關係？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "你在那裡閒著無聊，做了許多俄羅斯娃娃吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "是這樣沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "聽說去考察的哥倫比亞人很喜歡這種“薩爾貢”工藝品，梅蘭德的人找皮加爾要了獨家代理權。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "這……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "這太荒唐了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "當地人搖身一變，全成了薩爾貢的“傳統”手藝人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "然後領主小姐拿這第一桶金找哥倫比亞人買了適宜在荒漠生長的糧食種子，還把鎮子翻新了一遍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "順便一提，老領主的宅子被皮加爾修成花園了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "以我們的眼光來看，她做得還不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "哼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "那——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "——米亞羅醫生的墓，還在嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "……墓石一直在被風沙侵蝕，已經有些崩落了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "……我幫他擦了墓碑，獻了一束花，然後請當地人做了個小防風棚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "我想他在另外一個世界過得很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "好，那很不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "咳嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "整體來說，薩爾貢是個有趣的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "他們的語言發展情況，和我去過的其他國家都大不相同。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "即使是同一個地區的人，都會因為種族差異而帶有不同的口音。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "有些音調只在特定的種族中出現，其他種族的人幾乎沒有重複出現的可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "除非，他們變成蜥蜴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "或是其他什麼奇怪生物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "你的關注點很特別。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "這是我的專業。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "說到語言，我在薩爾貢經過了一個很特別的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "阿卡胡拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "阿……卡……呼……啦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "是阿卡胡拉，醫療部那位阿達克利斯小姐的老家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "嘉維爾，我聽說過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "我沒想到在薩爾貢還能找到這樣一個天堂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "可惜，那裡的阿達克利斯“熱情過度”，能用拳頭交流都懶得動口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "最後盾牌使用頻率過高，碰！壞了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "在離開阿卡胡拉前，我只能暫時用木材加閃光彈製造了一塊盾牌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "很有趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "雨林裡有不少獨特的獵物，蒂娜你會喜歡那裡的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "用餐時間差不多到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "各位下午有什麼安排？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "我想我可能得去人事部搞套新制服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "薩爾貢的沙子算是把整套制服都毀了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "再穿著它，我甚至無法隱蔽自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "是個人都能沿著一路落下的沙礫找到我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "真是災難。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "那麼，兩小時後，羅德島訓練場集合，各位沒有意見吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "眾人",
      "text": "沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "我們已經很久沒有作為一支小隊進行日常訓練了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "希望各位還記得對抗演習的重點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "解散，兩小時後見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "晚點見，各位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "行動起來吧，科茨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "今天還有許多任務等待著你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅德島\n虹彩小隊臨時宿舍"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "新制服、新裝備，這下就差不多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "讓我看看——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "BLITZ看著宿舍鏡子中的自己。\n在這段時間裡，他獨自一人遊歷薩爾貢，尋找著回家的線索。\n從薩爾貢或繁榮或頹廢的城市，到阿卡胡拉茂密的叢林，沒有地方能阻攔他探索的腳步。\n但焚風熱土是個例外。\n在那裡，似乎時間都被黃沙支配。\n一天，兩天，十天。\n眼前的景色從來沒有改變過。\n就那麼在沙中踏步。\n一無所獲。\n他害怕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他也不清楚自己是何時下定決心返回的，在那段時間裡，前進與後退似乎沒有區別。\n直到回到那個熱土邊境的安全屋時，生存的知覺才回到身體上。\n緊接著，就是如潮水般湧來的疲憊。\n每次想起，都感到害怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "怎麼樣，狀態還好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "嗯……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "等下請你子彈吃個夠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "那我先過去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "（拍拍BLITZ的肩膀）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "熟悉的聲音把他從回憶拉回現實。\n他看著自己手中那把改造銃，還有充滿電能的盾牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "對抗演習，應該是我和ASH對付FROST和TACHANKA吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "合作，對抗，與戰友共同達成戰術目標。\n他突然覺得心中充滿了幹勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "該給他們個驚喜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "四小時後\n羅德島本艦訓練場"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "呼，哈……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "曾經那麼一刻，他想過把探索熱土的路走到盡頭。不成功便成仁。\n但在某一天，多喝了一口安全屋兄弟送的神秘飲料，處於清醒與迷幻的間隙中時，他突然意識到一點：\n自己舉盾衝刺，迫切地想要獲得成果。\n卻把自己的隊友們遠遠甩在了身後。\n艾力亞斯·科茨，幹員BLITZ。\n職責是護衛隊友。\n為FROST創造佈陷機會。\n把敵人引向TACHANKA的槍前。\n給ASH提供一些建議。\n而非一人獨行，涉險探索。\n他明白了。\n所以現在，他回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "我都快忘記上一次踩中踏墊是什麼感覺了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "謝天謝地，FROST，你沒有拿對付怪物的陷阱對付我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "把感謝留給ASH吧，沒有那發榴彈你本該出局的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "這畢竟只是二對二對抗訓練，許多要素要比實際情況簡單。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "亞歷山大的設防位置我已經用無人機確認過多次，所以才敢冒險。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "如果使用的不是訓練彈，你沒有機會的，ASH。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "我明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "所以我鑽了這個空子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "哈……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "希望我們四個一下子消失，沒把ELA、IANA她們一起捲進來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "但願如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "很可惜，我們再也沒辦法湊成一支完整的五人特種小隊了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "有沒有考慮過在這片大地上招募點新人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "我們是反恐特種部隊成員，不是軍事承包商手底下的雇傭兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "維護和平是，曾經是，我們唯一的任務。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "很可惜，這裡的和平比地球的還要脆弱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "所以，現在我們要做的，是生存，還有尋找回家的路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "無論有多少新鮮血液，他們都不會和我們一起把這條路走到盡頭的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "嗯哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "但這種差別，真的有那麼大嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "比我們各自的國家之間的區別還要大？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "以前有老上司六號幫我們擦屁股，現在呢，一切都看我們自己的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "或許你可以嘗試著讓自己融入這個世界，ASH。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "我們離開熟悉的環境很久了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "但適應這裡之後，或許會覺得這個糟糕的地方，可能還有些可取之處。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "回家很重要，但那不是全部，寇恩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "在找到回家的路之前，或許可以先想想，怎麼去生活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "怎麼樣可以讓我們放下槍之後，還能行走在這片大地上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "這就是你的想法？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "只是一個建議。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "來自朋友的建議。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "我會考慮的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "有人來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "好久不見，虹彩小隊的各位幹員。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "歡迎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "歡迎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "等等，ASH，這是怎麼回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "我們也是來訓練的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "法倫",
      "text": "或者說，是來接受訓練的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格瑞斯",
      "text": "各位好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "既然新的對手就位了，那讓我們開始吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "ASH，你不會是想……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "我們是幹員，我們是虹彩小隊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "希望各位能夠接受這場挑戰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "我接受。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "那我得換種踏墊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "你呢，BLITZ？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "答案顯而易見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "拒絕可不是我的選項，ASH。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "我準備好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
